---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Mark from '../components/Mark.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Products"
  description="Foundation — an integrated business operating system we adapt to each industry. Hyphos — enterprise knowledge and apprenticeship. Two products from Hyphos Consulting."
>

  {/* Header */}
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 sm:px-8 pt-20 sm:pt-28 pb-12">
    <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Our products</div>
    <h1 class="display text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight text-ink-900">
      Two products. One way of thinking about software.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-ink-600 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
      <strong class="text-ink-900">Foundation</strong> — our integrated business operating system, adapted per industry to replace the patchwork most companies run on. <strong class="text-ink-900">Hyphos</strong> — the enterprise knowledge platform that captures expertise and accelerates apprenticeship at scale. We own and operate both.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="rule"></div>

  {/* ─── Foundation — the integrated business platform ─── */}
  <section id="foundation" class="scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 pt-20 sm:pt-24 pb-8">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-5">
        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-signal-50 text-signal-700 text-xs font-semibold">Foundation</span>
        <span class="text-sm text-ink-500">Production-ready · adapted per vertical</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="display text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-ink-900 leading-tight">
        Foundation — the integrated business operating system.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-ink-600 max-w-3xl">
        Front-of-house, back-of-house, finance, marketing — sharing one database, one source of truth, one set of relationships. Shaped to fit your industry.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl space-y-5 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Most businesses run on a tangle of single-purpose subscriptions. A separate CRM. A scheduling tool. A marketing platform. A website nobody updates. Time tracking in a spreadsheet. QuickBooks living in its own world. The people in the middle absorb the cost of stitching it all together.
        </p>
        <p>
          We've built and own the alternative: Foundation handles all of it, in one system, with one underlying database. Then we shape it to your industry — your specific workflows, integrations, regulatory constraints, and customer journeys. You get the speed of an off-the-shelf product with the fit of custom software.
        </p>
        <p class="text-ink-900">
          <strong>The premise:</strong> automate the repeatable parts so your team's time goes back to the part you actually hired them for — the relationships, the judgment, the care.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* ─── Full module grid — everything Foundation does ─── */}
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 pb-8">
      <div class="rule mb-10"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between gap-3 mb-8">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow mb-2">What Foundation does</div>
          <h3 class="display text-2xl text-ink-900 leading-tight">Sixteen integrated modules. One database underneath.</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-500 max-w-xs">Every module shares the same customer, the same calendar, the same financials. Nothing gets re-entered.</p>
      </div>

      {/* ─── Foundation architecture diagram ─── */}
      <div class="mb-14 bg-cream-100/60 border border-ink-200/60 rounded-2xl px-6 sm:px-10 py-10 sm:py-14">
        <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto">

          {/* Desktop connector layer */}
          <svg
            class="hidden lg:block absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none"
            viewBox="0 0 800 480"
            preserveAspectRatio="none"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="link-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#1d6fe0" stop-opacity="0.5"/>
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#1d6fe0" stop-opacity="0.5"/>
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            {/* Lines from each corner pod toward the central hub */}
            <path d="M 220 100 C 320 100, 360 220, 400 240" stroke="#1d6fe0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 4" fill="none" opacity="0.7"/>
            <path d="M 580 100 C 480 100, 440 220, 400 240" stroke="#1d6fe0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 4" fill="none" opacity="0.7"/>
            <path d="M 220 380 C 320 380, 360 260, 400 240" stroke="#1d6fe0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 4" fill="none" opacity="0.7"/>
            <path d="M 580 380 C 480 380, 440 260, 400 240" stroke="#1d6fe0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 4" fill="none" opacity="0.7"/>
          </svg>

          {/* 2x2 pod grid */}
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8 lg:gap-x-72 lg:gap-y-12 relative">

            {/* Front of house pod */}
            <div class="card p-5 bg-white">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></div>
                <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink-900 uppercase tracking-wider">Front of house</span>
              </div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></span>Clients</div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></span>Portal</div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></span>Website</div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></span>Comms</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* Back of house pod */}
            <div class="card p-5 bg-white">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-warm-500"></div>
                <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink-900 uppercase tracking-wider">Back of house</span>
              </div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-warm-500"></span>Time</div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-warm-500"></span>Docs</div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-warm-500"></span>Meetings</div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-warm-500"></span>Schedule</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* Finance pod */}
            <div class="card p-5 bg-white">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-ink-700"></div>
                <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink-900 uppercase tracking-wider">Finance</span>
              </div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-ink-700"></span>Estimating</div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-ink-700"></span>AP</div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-ink-700"></span>QuickBooks</div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-ink-700"></span>Reporting</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* Marketing pod */}
            <div class="card p-5 bg-white">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></div>
                <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink-900 uppercase tracking-wider">Marketing &amp; growth</span>
              </div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></span>SEO</div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></span>Social</div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></span>Campaigns</div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-600"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-signal-500"></span>Analytics</div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

          {/* Mobile-only down chevron between pods and hub */}
          <div class="lg:hidden flex justify-center my-6 text-signal-500">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
          </div>

          {/* Center hub — Foundation core. Absolutely positioned on desktop,
              flow-positioned on mobile. Light featured card so the diagram
              reads as a single warm tone, not a stark contrast moment. */}
          <div class="lg:absolute lg:top-1/2 lg:left-1/2 lg:-translate-x-1/2 lg:-translate-y-1/2 flex justify-center">
            <div class="relative w-full max-w-[220px] lg:max-w-[200px] aspect-square">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-3xl bg-signal-500/15 blur-2xl"></div>
              <div class="relative w-full h-full rounded-3xl bg-white p-5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center border-2 border-signal-300/60 shadow-xl shadow-signal-500/10">
                <Mark size={48} color="#0b1220" accent="#1d6fe0" />
                <div class="mt-3 display text-base leading-tight text-ink-900">Foundation</div>
                <div class="mt-1.5 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-signal-700">One shared database</div>
                <div class="mt-2 text-[10px] text-ink-500 leading-relaxed">Customer · Calendar · Financials · Documents · Audit</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <p class="mt-10 lg:mt-12 text-center text-sm text-ink-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Every module reads from and writes to the same shared core. Add a customer once — they're a CRM record, a portal user, an invoicing contact, and a marketing audience member simultaneously.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Front of house */}
      <div class="mb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="display text-base text-ink-900">Front of house</span>
          <span class="flex-1 h-px bg-ink-200"></span>
          <span class="text-xs text-ink-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Customer-facing</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-signal-50 text-signal-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19.128a9.38 9.38 0 002.625.372 9.337 9.337 0 004.121-.952 4.125 4.125 0 00-7.533-2.493M15 19.128v-.003c0-1.113-.285-2.16-.786-3.07M15 19.128v.106A12.318 12.318 0 018.624 21c-2.331 0-4.512-.645-6.374-1.766l-.001-.109a6.375 6.375 0 0111.964-3.07M12 6.375a3.375 3.375 0 11-6.75 0 3.375 3.375 0 016.75 0zm8.25 2.25a2.625 2.625 0 11-5.25 0 2.625 2.625 0 015.25 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-0.5">Clients &amp; CRM</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">Profiles, history, relationships — the master record everything else references.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-signal-50 text-signal-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18.75a60.07 60.07 0 0115.797 2.101c.727.198 1.453-.342 1.453-1.096V18.75M3.75 4.5v.75A.75.75 0 013 6h-.75m0 0v-.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H20.25M2.25 6v9m18-10.5v.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75h.75m-1.5-1.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v9.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-.375m1.5-1.5H21a.75.75 0 00-.75.75v.75m0 0H3.75m0 0h-.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V15m1.5 1.5v-.75A.75.75 0 003 15h-.75M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm3 0h.008v.008H18V10.5zm-12 0h.008v.008H6V10.5z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-0.5">Client portal</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">Self-serve access for clients to documents, status, approvals, and history.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-signal-50 text-signal-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 008.716-6.747M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 01-8.716-6.747M12 21c2.485 0 4.5-4.03 4.5-9S14.485 3 12 3m0 18c-2.485 0-4.5-4.03-4.5-9S9.515 3 12 3m0 0a8.997 8.997 0 017.843 4.582M12 3a8.997 8.997 0 00-7.843 4.582m15.686 0A11.953 11.953 0 0112 10.5c-2.998 0-5.74-1.1-7.843-2.918m15.686 0A8.959 8.959 0 0121 12c0 .778-.099 1.533-.284 2.253m0 0A17.919 17.919 0 0112 16.5c-3.162 0-6.133-.815-8.716-2.247m0 0A9.015 9.015 0 013 12c0-1.605.42-3.113 1.157-4.418"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-0.5">Front-end website</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">Your public site, managed inside Foundation — content, forms, and bookings live in the same database.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-signal-50 text-signal-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75a4.5 4.5 0 01-4.884 4.484c-1.076-.091-2.264.071-2.95.904l-7.152 8.684a2.548 2.548 0 11-3.586-3.586l8.684-7.152c.833-.686.995-1.874.904-2.95a4.5 4.5 0 016.336-4.486l-3.276 3.276a3.004 3.004 0 002.25 2.25l3.276-3.276c.256.565.398 1.192.398 1.852z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-0.5">Communications</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">Email cadences, letters, anniversaries, nurture — brand-voice governed, never generic.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Back of house */}
      <div class="mb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="display text-base text-ink-900">Back of house</span>
          <span class="flex-1 h-px bg-ink-200"></span>
          <span class="text-xs text-ink-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Daily operations</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-warm-500/10 text-warm-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-0.5">Time tracking</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">Timesheets, billable hours, project allocation — flowing straight into invoicing.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-warm-500/10 text-warm-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0113.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375H8.25m2.25 0H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 00-9-9z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-0.5">Documents &amp; templates</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">Generate, route, and store every document — contracts, estimates, agreements — auto-filled from client data.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-warm-500/10 text-warm-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 5.25a3 3 0 013 3m3 0a6 6 0 01-7.029 5.912c-.563-.097-1.159.026-1.563.43L10.5 17.25H8.25v2.25H6v2.25H2.25v-2.818c0-.597.237-1.17.659-1.591l6.499-6.499c.404-.404.527-1 .43-1.563A6 6 0 1121.75 8.25z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-0.5">Meeting capture</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">Transcribe meetings, extract decisions and action items, link them to the right client and project.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-warm-500/10 text-warm-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-0.5">Scheduling &amp; intake</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">Bookings, intake forms, calendars — one source of truth across staff and clients.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Finance */}
      <div class="mb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="display text-base text-ink-900">Finance</span>
          <span class="flex-1 h-px bg-ink-200"></span>
          <span class="text-xs text-ink-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Money in and out</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-ink-100 text-ink-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 8.25H7.5a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v9a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h9a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-9a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H15M9 12l3 3m0 0l3-3m-3 3V2.25"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-0.5">Estimating &amp; pricing</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">Build estimates from your live price book, send for approval, convert to invoices automatically.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-ink-100 text-ink-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.5 6v.75m0 3v.75m0 3v.75m0 3V18m-9-5.25h5.25M7.5 15h3M3.375 5.25c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v3.026a2.999 2.999 0 010 5.198v3.026c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h17.25c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125v-3.026a2.999 2.999 0 010-5.198V6.375c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125H3.375z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-0.5">Accounts payable</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">Automated invoice receipt &amp; processing — bills land via email or upload, AI extracts &amp; codes the line items, routes for approval, posts to QuickBooks, and queues for payment.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-ink-100 text-ink-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.5 8.25V6a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H6A2.25 2.25 0 003.75 6v8.25A2.25 2.25 0 006 16.5h2.25m8.25-8.25H18a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18A2.25 2.25 0 0118 20.25h-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 018.25 18v-1.5m8.25-8.25h-6a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v6"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-0.5">QuickBooks sync</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">Two-way integration: invoices, payments, clients, and chart of accounts stay in sync — no exports.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-ink-100 text-ink-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
